# Local overrides on top of the shared global gitignore.
#
# The global ignore (/root/.config/git/ignore, via core.excludesFile) excludes
# `data/` because of ML datasets that are too large for this phone. That rule is
# correct for model work but WRONG here: the hackathon kit's data/ is the
# 11 MB synthetic dataset the whole evaluation runs on. Re-include it.

!data/
!The-Sequential-Matching-Problem/data/
!The-Sequential-Matching-Problem/data/**

# Never commit credentials or evaluation secrets even if someone drops them in.
*.env
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# Scratch
results/**/raw/
*.log
__pycache__/
# Kaggle kernel working dir (regenerate with ./build_kaggle_bundle.sh)
kaggle-kernel/

# Raw kaggle output downloads (curated copies live in research/results/)
kaggle-out/
